-- #   * Requires NO extensions (no pgcrypto / citext / pgvector).            #
-- #   * Safe on a fresh Supabase project.                                    #
-- #   * Idempotent: every statement is guarded, so re-running is a no-op.    #
-- #   * Drops nothing and renames nothing.                                   #
